("composition-with-large-red-plane-yellow-black-grey-and-",9,0,"A big red square, a yellow rectangle and a small blue block sit in a grid of thick black lines. By 1921 Mondrian had arrived at the style that made him famous, using only primary colors, black, white and straight lines."),
